            "Targets": {
              "Clusters": "MultiAzCluster",
            },
          },
        },
        "Description": "[I-2] Multi-AZ DB cluster failover: promotes a readable standby to writer. Measures client-visible downtime of the 1-writer + 2-readable-standby topology.",
